# RG HUD Versioning

Before committing or pushing any change to `rg_hud.user.js`:

- Increment the release version for that change set.
- Update both the `// @version` metadata value and the `SCRIPT_VERSION`
  fallback string to the same version.
- Keep versions decimal-orderly because `SCRIPT_VERSION_NUM` uses
  `parseFloat`: advance `13.9` to `14.0`, never `13.10`.
- Verify the two active version values match before committing.
- Preserve historical comments such as `// v13.6`; they record when code was
  introduced and are not active version declarations.
